        "type": "game",
        "name": "Detective Malinowski The Truth Will Be Revealed",
        "steam_appid": 2334690,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334690/extras/1a94f0955a3f34dcb8c26445b9684a71.avif?t=1778325466\" width=616 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Body found.</strong> Two missing. Detective Malinowski hears what others miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric noir detective adventure (~2–3 hours of tense investigation you can complete in one sitting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Detective Malinowski, a seasoned investigator drawn into a case that hits dangerously close to home. What begins as routine police work in a shadowy city quickly turns into a personal hunt for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate atmospheric locations using your wits and your hearing. Footsteps in empty hallways, creaking doors and faint radio melodies all carry clues. <strong>Listen carefully</strong> to move from scene to scene and piece together what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>graphic compass</strong> helps you move through each location, while hand‑drawn illustrations capture key moments in your personal sketchbook — a visual record of the entire case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full </strong>English and Polish<strong> voice acting</strong> brings Malinowski’s world to life through dialogue, inner monologues and environmental audio. <i>Subtitles</i> in both languages make the whole story fully accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story leads you toward one gripping conclusion. No branching paths — just focused exploration, careful listening and atmosphere that thickens with every scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original music and ambient soundscapes</strong> build a tense noir mood, especially <i>on headphones</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect if you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like short, story‑driven detective games you can finish in a single evening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want story‑first experiences where sound and ambient audio guide your next step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer focused, linear stories with one strong conclusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Value games built around atmosphere, ambient sound, music and voice acting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truth waits for no one. Start now.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334690/extras/1a94f0955a3f34dcb8c26445b9684a71.avif?t=1778325466\" width=616 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Body found.</strong> Two missing. Detective Malinowski hears what others miss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric noir detective adventure (~2–3 hours of tense investigation you can complete in one sitting).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of Detective Malinowski, a seasoned investigator drawn into a case that hits dangerously close to home. What begins as routine police work in a shadowy city quickly turns into a personal hunt for the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate atmospheric locations using your wits and your hearing. Footsteps in empty hallways, creaking doors and faint radio melodies all carry clues. <strong>Listen carefully</strong> to move from scene to scene and piece together what really happened.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>graphic compass</strong> helps you move through each location, while hand‑drawn illustrations capture key moments in your personal sketchbook — a visual record of the entire case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full </strong>English and Polish<strong> voice acting</strong> brings Malinowski’s world to life through dialogue, inner monologues and environmental audio. <i>Subtitles</i> in both languages make the whole story fully accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story leads you toward one gripping conclusion. No branching paths — just focused exploration, careful listening and atmosphere that thickens with every scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original music and ambient soundscapes</strong> build a tense noir mood, especially <i>on headphones</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect if you:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like short, story‑driven detective games you can finish in a single evening.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want story‑first experiences where sound and ambient audio guide your next step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prefer focused, linear stories with one strong conclusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Value games built around atmosphere, ambient sound, music and voice acting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truth waits for no one. Start now.</strong></p>",
        "short_description": "Body found. Two missing. Detective Malinowski hears what others miss. Noir adventure where sound reveals clues and sketches tell the story. A short case you can finish tonight. Start now.",
